# Conformance probe pack whose field after the inner block maps a key the
# inner pack maps (spec 0.34, Decode step 4), most significant bit first.
# Public. No kinds.
#
#   block       an 8-bit length in bytes, then one conformance-inner-seq message
#               to the end of the block
#   byte        x, after the block (the inner kind a maps x too, read first)
format     conformance-inner-after
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
length 8
  inner  conformance-inner-seq
end
field   probe.x  8  uint
